<Layout title="Conditions d'Utilisation — Motiva Hub" description="Les conditions régissant votre utilisation de Motiva Hub : propriété du contenu, usage acceptable, liens affiliés et responsabilité. Lisez les conditions d'utilisation complètes.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 data-i18n="termsPageTitle">Conditions d'Utilisation</h1>
      <p data-i18n="termsLastUpdated"><strong>Dernière mise à jour :</strong> 20 août 2026</p>
      <p data-i18n="termsIntro">En utilisant le site web de Motiva Hub, vous acceptez ces conditions.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsContentTitle">Contenu et Utilisation</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsContentP1">All content on this site — articles, guides, and quotes — is provided for general information and personal development purposes. You may read and share our content with a link back to the original article. Republishing our full articles without permission is not allowed.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsEarningsTitle">No Earnings Guarantee</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsEarningsP1">We do not make any claims about earnings, income, or results. Personal growth is a long, individual process. Nothing on this site is a promise of a particular outcome.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsIpTitle">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsIpP1">The Motiva Hub name, logo, and all original content are our property. Contact us if you wish to use any material commercially.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsLinksTitle">External Links</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsLinksP1">Our site may contain links to external websites, including affiliate links to booksellers. We are not responsible for the content or practices of external sites.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsChangesTitle">Changes</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsChangesP1">We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="termsContactTitle">Contact</h2>
      <p data-i18n="termsContactP1">Questions? Reach us through our <Link href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>